msgstr "Nyamukuru"

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Compare loss and latency with the SmokePing graphs and maintenance state. Escalate missing files, imports and relinking to an administrator."
msgstr "Gereranya gutakaza amapaketi n'ubukererwe n'imbonerahamwe za SmokePing ndetse n'imiterere y'ubugenzuzi. Ohereza ku muyobozi amadosiye abuze, ibyo kwinjiza no kongera guhuza."

