msgstr "YAML (mburabuzi)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Uburenganzira bwawe ku bikoresho ntibugera kuri buri gikoresho, bityo ntushobora kohereza hanze cyangwa kwinjiza igenamiterere rya SmokePing. Baza umuyobozi ufite uburenganzira ku bikoresho byose."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Kohereza hanze igenamiterere rya SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Iyoherezwa hanze ribika amagenamiterere y'inyongera, intego za SmokePing inyongera yasomye, ndetse n'igikoresho buri imwe ihujwe na cyo, hakurikijwe izina rya host n'ibisobanuro by'igikoresho. Ntibikubiyemo isoko y'amakuru, imbonerahamwe, dosiye ya RRD, cyangwa ibyangombwa byo kwinjira."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Manura"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Kwinjiza igenamiterere rya SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Guhitamo dosiye birayisuzuma gusa. Mugaragaza ikurikira yerekana buri mpinduka dosiye yakora, kandi nta kintu cyandikwa kugeza igihe wemeje urwo rutonde. Kwinjiza byongeraho kandi bikavugurura; ntibisiba intego cyangwa ngo byimure ihuza, kandi ntibikora dosiye ya RRD cyangwa ngo bikore ku bubiko bw'amakuru bwa SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Suzuma dosiye"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Isuzuma ryo kwinjiza"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Nta kintu cyanditswe."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Subira inyuma"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Dosiye ntishobora kwinjizwa kugeza igihe aya makosa akosowe. Nta kintu cyanditswe."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Iyinjizwa risanzwe rihuye na dosiye. Nta kintu cyo kwinjiza gihari."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Gahunda %s. Gushyira mu bikorwa bikora izi mpinduka neza mu gikorwa kimwe. Niba dosiye cyangwa iyinjizwa ryahindutse kuva kuri iri suzuma, kwinjiza birangwa kandi wongere usuzume."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Shyira mu bikorwa iyinjiza"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Hagarika"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Ongeraho intego za SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "nta ntego ya SmokePing ihuye"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Kanda Komeza kugira ngo wongereho intego za SmokePing zifite host ihuye n'izina rya host rya buri gikoresho cyahiswemo. Buri ntego ihabwa imbonerahamwe y'incamake yo kumenyesha kandi, igihe amakuru ya SmokePing ashobora gushushanywa, imbonerahamwe ya smoke. Ibikoresho ntibikorerwa hano na rimwe."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Intego %d zirahuye."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Ibintu %d byaremwe cyangwa byahujwe, %d byasimbutswe."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Iki gikoresho gifite intego za SmokePing, ariko umusomyi wuzuza agaciro k'incamake yazo akorera kuri poller %d kandi igikoresho kibitswe kuri poller %d. Agaciro k'incamake n'ibimenyetso birahagarara kugeza igihe igikoresho cyongeye guhabwa poller %d."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Intego za SmokePing z'iki gikoresho"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe za smoke %d ziracyashushanya ayandi mabara; poller nkuru yimura kugeza kuri 200 muri buri kiciro."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe za smoke %d ntizashoboye kwimurwa; koresha upgrade-graphs kugira ngo wongere uzigerageze, kandi urebe inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti kugira ngo umenye impamvu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya Loss Colors risaba amabara yo gutakaza ya SmokePing %s, ariko umusomyi yabonye SmokePing %s. Rishyire kuri Automatic keretse niba imbonerahamwe zigomba gutandukana n'iza SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya Loss Colors rihitamo amabara yo gutakaza ya SmokePing %s ku mbonerahamwe za smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Umusomyi ntiyabonye verisiyo ya SmokePing, bityo igenamiterere rya Loss Colors rihitamo amabara yo gutakaza ya SmokePing 2.8 na nyuma yayo. Niba SmokePing ari 2.7, shyira Loss Colors kuri SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Umusomyi yabonye SmokePing %s, bityo igenamiterere rya Loss Colors rihitamo amabara yayo yo gutakaza."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Thold ntiyashyizwemo, bityo nta ntego itanga ibimenyetso muri SmokePing na Thold byombi."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Nta ntego ifite ikimenyetso cya SmokePing hamwe n'urugero rwa Thold rwemejwe byombi."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Intego %d zifite ikimenyetso cya SmokePing hamwe n'urugero rwa Thold rwemejwe byombi, bityo ikibazo kimwe gishobora kumenyeshwa kabiri. Gereranya ibisabwa by'ibimenyetso byazo mbere yo gukuraho kimwe muri byo: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za SmokePing zananiwe kwinjizwa kandi ntizongerwa kugeragezwa mu buryo bwikora: %s Koresha Ongera ugerageze kwinjiza inyandikorugero nyuma yo gukosora impamvu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za SmokePing ntizinjijwe. Koresha Ongera ugerageze kwinjiza inyandikorugero."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za SmokePing zinjijwe."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Buri gikoresho gifite amasoko y'amakuru y'incamake gisomwa na poller y'umusomyi."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Ibikoresho %d bifite amasoko y'amakuru y'incamake ariko ntibisomwa na poller %d, ikoresha umusomyi, bityo agaciro k'incamake yabyo n'ibimenyetso ntibigira amakuru: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya SmokePing risomerwa kuri poller %d, si kuri iyi seriveri; umurongo w'urutonde rw'ibikoresho werekana ibyavuye mu isoma ryayo riheruka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya SmokePing %s ntirishobora gusomwa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya SmokePing %s ryerekana intego %d; ibyanditswe %d byasimbutswe: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya SmokePing %s ryerekana intego %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'inzira ya PHP ririmo ubusa cyangwa si dosiye ikora, bityo umusomyi ntashobora gutangira."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Umusomyi atangirira kuri %s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Umusomyi ntararangiza igikorwa kuri iyi poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Igikorwa cy'umusomyi giheruka cyarangiye hashize amasegonda %d, arenze intera eshatu za poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Umusomyi yasomye ibice %d kuri %d mu masegonda %.1f kandi yarengeje igihe yagenwe inshuro %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Umusomyi yasomye ibice %d kuri %d mu masegonda %.1f, hashize amasegonda %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Nta rutonde rw'ibikoresho rwasomwe kuri iyi poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Urutonde rw'ibikoresho ruheruka rwananiwe hashize amasegonda %d kandi urwarubanjirije ruracyakoreshwa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Urutonde rw'ibikoresho rwanditse intego %d hashize amasegonda %d."

