#: lib/ImportPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "Import SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Kwinjiza igenamiterere rya SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Igenamiterere"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Dosiye ya SmokePing yashyizwe mu igenamiterere isomanwa n'amadosiye ikubiyemo, bivuye mu bubiko bwayo. Dosiye yoherejwe isomwa yonyine: @include ntiyemewe muri yo."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Dosiye iri mu igenamiterere, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "Dosiye yoherejwe, nta @include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Dosiye yoherejwe"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Kuri dosiye yoherejwe gusa: igenamiterere rya SmokePing ritarengeje MiB 4."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Ibikoresho"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Igikoresho kimwe kuri buri host ya SmokePing gikusanya intego zigenzura host imwe. Igikoresho gisanzwe gifite iryo zina rya host kuri poller yahiswemo gikoreshwa aho gukora igishya."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Igikoresho kimwe kuri buri host ya SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Igikoresho kimwe kuri buri ntego ya SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Inyandikorugero y'igikoresho"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero y'ibikoresho biremwa n'iyinjiza."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "Poller y'ibikoresho bishya. Igomba kuba poller ikoresha umusomyi wa SmokePing, bitabaye ibyo amasoko y'amakuru y'incamake yabyo ntabona amakuru."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Ikigo"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The site of new devices."
msgstr "Ikigo cy'ibikoresho bishya."

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nta na kimwe"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Igiti cy'imbonerahamwe"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Garagaza urutonde rwa SmokePing mu giti cy'imbonerahamwe: buri gice kiba ishami, kandi buri gikoresho kiba host munsi y'ishami ry'intego zacyo. Amashami na za host zisanzwe zikoreshwa bundi bushya."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Igiti gishya, cyitiriwe hepfo"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Ntukagaragaze"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'igiti gishya"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Ku giti gishya gusa. Igiti gisanzwe gifite iri zina kirakoreshwa."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Isubiramo risoma igenamiterere kandi rikerekana ibyo kwinjiza kwakora. Nta kintu cyandikwa kugeza igihe wemeje urwo rutonde kuri mugaragaza ikurikira, kandi amadosiye bwite ya SmokePing ntiyandikwamo na rimwe."

