msgid "Plan %s. Importing creates exactly what is listed above through Cacti's device, graph, and tree functions. If the SmokePing configuration or Cacti changed since this preview, the import is refused and you preview again."
msgstr "Gahunda %s. Kwinjiza birema neza ibyanditswe haruguru binyuze mu mikorere y'igikoresho, imbonerahamwe, n'igiti ya Cacti. Niba igenamiterere rya SmokePing cyangwa Cacti byarahindutse kuva kuri iri subira, kwinjiza birangwa kandi wongere usubiremo."

