msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Umukusanyi wa Cacti ukorera kuri seriveri ya SmokePing cyangwa usangiye na yo uburyo bwo kubika amadosiye. Uyu mukusanyi wenyine ni we usoma amakuru ya SmokePing."

