msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Dosiye nyamukuru y'igenamiterere rya SmokePing, isomwa n'umukusanyi ukoresha igisoma. Umugereka uyisoma hamwe n'amadosiye ikubiyemo ukoresheje isesengura ryawo bwite kandi ntuyandikamo na rimwe. Amadosiye akubiyemo agomba kuguma mu bubiko bw'iyi dosiye."

