msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'amakuru ya SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Agaciro ka datadir mu igenamiterere rya SmokePing, nk'uko SmokePing ikabona."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Ihuza rya Cacti ry'ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Ihuza rya bind cyangwa NFS ryo gusoma gusa ry'ububiko bw'amakuru ya SmokePing imbere mu nzira ya RRA ya Cacti. Cacti isoma gusa amadosiye ya RRD ari mu nzira yayo ya RRA kandi ntiyigera iyanyura muri symlink."

