msgstr "Amabara y'igihombo cya SmokePing ibishushanyo bya smoke bishushanya. SmokePing 2.7 ishushanya ibyiciro by'igihombo bitandukanye n'ibya 2.8 na nyuma yaho. Bikora byikora bikurikiza verisiyo ya SmokePing igisoma gisanga iruhande rwa SmokePing, yerekanywe ku rupapuro rw'ubuzima, kandi bigakoresha 2.8 na nyuma yaho iyo nta yo bisanze."

